          <div class="code">MULTI-YEAR ROOT-CAUSE PROGRAM</div>
          <p class="feat-desc note">Integrated five data systems across ~2,000 production charges. Causal inference + Design of Experiments isolated a supplier-chemistry × furnace-state interaction — driving a <strong>zero-CAPEX process-policy change</strong> plus a production fix, and replacing subjective inspection with quantitative acceptance criteria.</p>
